{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t伊朗傳媒星期二報道，南部格什姆島傳出爆炸聲並冒出濃煙。<br/>\n<br/>\n霍爾木茲甘省副省長其後證實，美軍襲擊格什姆島部分地點，但當地情況受控，居民區、商業和基礎設施沒有受損，救援、服務和行政部門處於全面戒備狀態；美軍暫時未有回應。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T19:39:36.986462+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T19:11:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T23:56:19.578485+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T19:33:08.838843+00:00","content_hash":"3d8938d64366a8486ce76f23ffc05b1c86a134734538e7afac22fdf3a4dea10e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}